   "runs": [
    {
     "text": "What is Yume? Rooted in an ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "artist’s vision of Japan",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": " and a deep ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "appreciation for its culture",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": ", YumePH transforms personal experiences and cherished memories into ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "wearable art",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": ". Each design captures the joy of discovering Japan, from savoring its beloved cuisine to exploring its iconic destinations, translating these moments into illustrations that ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "preserve the feeling of being there",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": ". Through every piece, YumePH invites others to ",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "normal",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
     "text": "experience Japan through the eyes of an artist",
     "size": 17.1,
     "weight": "bold",
     "color": "#1e1e1e",
     "align": "justify",
     "lh": 1,
     "ls": -0.02,
     "font": "YAFcfgcNhWk,3"
    },
    {
